{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/23(土)〜3/8(金)まで\nユーロスペース渋谷で\n『未来のあたし\n豊島圭介ショートフィルム映画祭』\nが上映されますよ〜〜✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上映時間は21:00〜で\n3/8(金)のみ19:00〜です‼️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントもたくさんあるようで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/23(土)は私と菜々香が登壇します✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/26(火)は私と豊島監督のトークショー✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3/7(火)は徳山大五郎を誰が殺したか?の脚本家である徳尾浩司さんと豊島監督のトークショーがあります✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非何回でも観に来てください✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🌙ユーロスペース公式HPhttp://www.eurospace.co.jp/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな菜々香と鍋パしました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タコパの次は鍋パ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNH4BGT1K2TC6ZFJ1MFD5H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミルフィーユ鍋です✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく美味しくできて大満足でした💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家入レオさんとTAKAHIRO先生のスペシャルコラボレーションのMステを観ながら一緒に食べました😆😆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人で『TAKAHIRO先生〜〜〜!!』ってずっと叫んでた(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高なコラボレーションでした😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば8thシングルのカップリング『Nobody』のMVが公開されましたねェ✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装がとっても可愛いですよね💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲も新鮮な感じでとっても好きです🎵"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNH5T0333RDSDFPTQ86DNR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNH6SCPKH5D88ZR